== Notes ==
* This spell is most often used to avoid the affects of the [[harm]] spell, however it is very useful in other cases to avoid ability point damage such as that from [[crippling strike]].
* This spell also prevents ability score decrease from an item if cast before equipping.
* This spell does not restore levels or ability scores already drained before the cast.
* This spell makes one immune to ability score decrease from [[poison]] or [[disease]], but not the poison or disease effects themselves.

